WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.270
Consistency asks whether the same concept is
represented the same way Mixed

00:00:06.296 --> 00:00:13.951
date formats category labels and units can create
serious interpretation problems Timeliness

00:00:13.964 --> 00:00:20.554
is different It asks whether the data is current
enough for the decision A

00:00:20.581 --> 00:00:26.081
fifteen-minute delay may be excellent for a monthly
reporting process but unacceptable for an emergency

00:00:26.107 --> 00:00:31.646
monitoring system Both dimensions require
documentation shared

00:00:31.659 --> 00:00:36.330
definitions for consistency and timestamps or
refresh expectations for timeliness
